     "content_html": "The <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-coordinate represents the number of minutes that Armando swims."
    },
    {
     "id": 1272504,
     "content_html": "The <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-coordinate represents the number of minutes that Armando swims."
